<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- JP Morgan cuts Malaysia gaming cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- JP Morgan cuts Malaysia gaming cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said it downgraded two Malaysian gaming companies to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- Downgraded companies are Genting Bhd and Resorts World Bhd .</p>
<p>-- Cited weaker than expected gaming revenue growth in first half of the year. Said an earnings recovery for the companies looks possible &quot;after 1998, at best.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Genting ADR's closed Wednesday at 3-3/4.</p>
</text>
